Value [text box] - DropDownList
Type in which item in the DropDownList will be selected when you open it. The value is identified by its
index number.
Remarks
This is one of the items which you typed into the list of Items.
Note
If you localize the items to another language, you will usually use the Value instead of the attribute
Item. The value is a number which is language-independent, while the Item is a string which differs from
language to language.
